/extras/1edfd32b86eef1ef631eda67be68ce57.mp4?t=1745628078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093880/extras/3e5bbd0bd0563e2986e8f1d045a8a952.avif?t=1745628078\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons (Riftblade, Revolvers, Saws, etc.)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manipulations (Growth, Speed, Knockback, etc.)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Events (Lava, The Void, Blizzards, etc.)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Curses (Explosion, Slowness, Marbles, etc.)</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
